: Long description shows a \"Show more\" toggle\n439:#### Test: Clicking \"Show more\" expands the full description\n444:#### Test: Clicking \"Show less\" collapses the description back\n449:#### Test: Show more/less toggle is functional on repeated use\n454:### Component: AmenitiesList\n456:#### Test: Amenities list displays amenities grouped by category with icons\n460:#### Test: Amenities list only shows categories that have amenities\n464:#### Test: Amenities list shows \"Show all amenities\" when there are many amenities\n468:#### Test: Clicking \"Show all amenities\" reveals the complete list\n473:#### Test: Amenities list displays message when property has no amenities\n477:### Component: BookingCard\n479:#### Test: Booking card displays price per night\n483:#### Test: Booking card displays check-in and check-out date pickers\n487:#### Test: Booking card displays guest count selector\n491:#### Test: Selecting dates and guests shows price breakdown\n496:#### Test: Price breakdown updates when dates change\n501:#### Test: Reserve button creates a booking when logged in\n506:#### Test: Reserve button is disabled when dates are not selected\n510:#### Test: Reserve button prompts login when user is not logged in\n515:#### Test: Reserve button is disabled for host's own property\n519:#### Test: Check-in date picker prevents selecting past dates\n524:#### Test: Check-out date must be after check-in date\n529:#### Test: Guest count cannot exceed property max_guests\n534:#### Test: Guest count minimum is 1\n539:#### Test: Reserve button shows error for unavailable dates\n544:#### Test: Booking card is sticky on desktop viewport\n549:#### Test: Booking card date pickers and guest selector are functional on repeated use\n554:### Component: ReviewsSection\n556:#### Test: Reviews section displays average ratings by category\n560:#### Test: Reviews section displays overall average rating and total review count\n564:#### Test: Reviews section displays individual review cards\n568:#### Test: Review cards display guest avatar or initial\n572:#### Test: Reviews section shows message when property has no reviews\n576:#### Test: Reviews section handles pagination or \"Show more\" for many reviews\n580:#### Test: Clicking \"Show all reviews\" reveals all review cards\n585:#### Test: Reviews are ordered by most recent first\n589:### Component: HostInfoCard\n591:#### Test: Host info card displays host name, avatar, bio, and member since date\n595:#### Test: Host info card displays number of listings\n599:#### Test: Host info card shows placeholder avatar when host has no avatar\n603:#### Test: Host info card displays correctly when host has no bio\n607:## Page: My Trips (`/trips`)\n611:### Component: TripsTabs\n613:#### Test: My Trips page requires login\n618:#### Test: My Trips page defaults to Upcoming tab\n622:#### Test: Upcoming tab shows pending and confirmed future bookings\n627:#### Test: Switching to Past tab shows completed bookings\n632:#### Test: Switching to Cancelled tab shows cancelled bookings\n637:#### Test: Switching back to Upcoming tab from another tab\n642:#### Test: Tab shows empty state when no bookings exist for that category\n647:#### Test: Upcoming tab empty state message\n652:#### Test: Cancelled tab empty state message\n657:#### Test: Tabs are functional on repeated use\n662:### Component: TripCard\n664:#### Test: Trip card displays all required information\n668:#### Test: Trip card displays correct status badge colors\n672:#### Test: Trip card shows property image or placeholder\n676:#### Test: Clicking trip card navigates to booking details\n681:#### Test: Cancel button appears on pending bookings\n685:#### Test: Cancel button appears on confirmed bookings\n689:#### Test: Cancel button does not appear on completed bookings\n693:#### Test: Cancel button does not appear on already cancelled bookings\n697:#### Test: Write Review button appears on completed bookings without a review\n701:#### Test: Write Review button does not appear on completed bookings that already have a review\n705:#### Test: Clicking Write Review button navigates to review page\n710:#### Test: Write Review button does not appear on pending, confirmed, or cancelled bookings\n714:#### Test: Trip cards are ordered by check-in date\n718:### Component: CancelBookingDialog\n720:#### Test: Clicking Cancel button opens confirmation dialog\n725:#### Test: Confirming cancellation updates booking status to cancelled\n730:#### Test: Dismissing cancellation dialog keeps booking unchanged\n735:#### Test: Closing the dialog via overlay click keeps booking unchanged\n740:#### Test: Cancel dialog shows property and date context\n744:#### Test: After cancellation, booking moves from Upcoming to Cancelled tab\n749:#### Test: Cancel dialog is functional on repeated use\n754:## Page: Host Dashboard (`/hosting`)\n758:### Component: StatsOverview\n760:#### Test: Host Dashboard requires login — redirects unauthenticated users\n765:#### Test: Host Dashboard requires host status — shows upgrade prompt for non-hosts\n770:#### Test: Stats overview displays total listings count\n775:#### Test: Stats overview displays active bookings count\n780:#### Test: Stats overview displays total earnings\n785:#### Test: Stats overview displays average rating\n790:#### Test: Stats overview shows zeros for a new host with no data\n795:#### Test: Host Dashboard displays navigation tabs for Listings and Bookings\n800:#### Test: Switching between Listings and Bookings tabs\n805:### Component: ListingsTab\n807:#### Test: Listings tab displays host's properties in a grid\n812:#### Test: Listing card shows property details\n816:#### Test: Listing card has Edit button that navigates to property detail\n821:#### Test: Listing card has Deactivate button for active properties\n826:#### Test: Confirming deactivation sets property to inactive\n831:#### Test: Dismissing deactivation dialog keeps property active\n836:#### Test: Listing card shows Activate button for inactive properties\n841:#### Test: Listings tab shows empty state for host with no properties\n845:#### Test: Add Listing button is visible on the Listings tab\n849:#### Test: Deactivate and activate actions work on repeated use\n854:### Component: BookingsTab\n856:#### Test: Bookings tab displays table of bookings for host's properties\n861:#### Test: Bookings table shows correct data for each booking\n865:#### Test: Bookings tab has status filter controls\n869:#### Test: Filtering bookings by Pending status\n874:#### Test: Filtering bookings by Confirmed status\n879:#### Test: Filtering bookings by Completed status\n884:#### Test: Filtering bookings by Cancelled status\n889:#### Test: Resetting filter to All shows all bookings\n894:#### Test: Status filters work on repeated use\n899:#### Test: Host can confirm a pending booking\n904:#### Test: Host can cancel a pending booking\n909:#### Test: Confirming cancellation of a booking updates status\n914:#### Test: Dismissing booking cancellation dialog keeps booking unchanged\n919:#### Test: Host can cancel a confirmed booking\n924:#### Test: Completed and cancelled bookings have no action buttons\n928:#### Test: Bookings tab shows empty state when no bookings exist\n933:#### Test: Status badges display correct colors\n937:#### Test: Confirm and cancel actions work on repeated use\n942:### Component: AddListingForm\n944:#### Test: Clicking Add Listing button opens the multi-step form\n949:#### Test: Step 1 — Property type selection and title input\n953:#### Test: Step 1 — Selecting property type and entering title\n958:#### Test: Step 1 — Validation prevents proceeding without required fields\n963:#### Test: Step 2 — Location fields displayed\n967:#### Test: Step 2 — Address field uses autocomplete\n972:#### Test: Step 2 — Address autocomplete populates related fields\n977:#### Test: Step 2 — Validation requires city and country\n982:#### Test: Step 3 — Details fields displayed\n986:#### Test: Step 3 — Setting property details\n991:#### Test: Step 3 — Validation requires all detail fields\n996:#### Test: Step 4 — Amenities selection displayed\n1000:#### Test: Step 4 — Selecting amenities\n1005:#### Test: Step 4 — Amenities are toggleable\n1010:#### Test: Step 5 — Photo URL input displayed\n1014:#### Test: Step 5 — Adding a photo URL\n1019:#### Test: Step 5 — Adding multiple photo URLs\n1024:#### Test: Step 5 — Removing a photo\n1029:#### Test: Step 5 — Validation requires at least one photo\n1034:#### Test: Step 6 — Pricing fields displayed\n1038:#### Test: Step 6 — Entering pricing information\n1043:#### Test: Step 6 — Validation requires price per night\n1048:#### Test: Step 7 — Review and publish page displayed\n1052:#### Test: Step 7 — Review page shows all entered data correctly\n1056:#### Test: Publishing a new listing creates the property\n1061:#### Test: Back button navigates to the previous step\n1066:#### Test: Cancel button closes the form without saving\n1071:#### Test: Confirming cancel discards the listing form\n1076:#### Test: Dismissing cancel keeps the form open\n1081:#### Test: Step indicator shows correct progress throughout the form\n1086:#### Test: Data persistence across steps when navigating back and forth\n1091:#### Test: Add Listing form works correctly on repeated use\n1096:## Page: User Profile (`/profile`)\n1100:### Component: ProfileForm\n1102:#### Test: Profile page requires login\n1107:#### Test: Profile page displays current user info\n1112:#### Test: Edit name field inline\n1117:#### Test: Edit bio field inline\n1122:#### Test: Edit phone field inline\n1127:#### Test: Edit avatar URL field inline\n1132:#### Test: Save with empty name shows validation error\n1137:#### Test: Save with invalid avatar URL shows validation error\n1142:#### Test: Profile form fields are functional on repeated edits\n1147:#### Test: Email field is displayed but not editable\n1152:#### Test: Profile update persists across navigation\n1157:### Component: BecomeHostButton\n1159:#### Test: Become a Host button is visible for non-host users\n1164:#### Test: Become a Host button is hidden for existing hosts\n1169:#### Test: Clicking Become a Host sets user as host\n1174:#### Test: Cancel Become a Host confirmation dialog\n1179:#### Test: Become a Host button appearance\n1184:### Component: UserReviewsList\n1186:#### Test: Reviews list displays user's written reviews\n1191:#### Test: Reviews list shows empty state for user with no reviews\n1196:#### Test: Review card shows rating with star display\n1201:#### Test: Review card links to the reviewed property\n1206:#### Test: Reviews list shows review details correctly\n1211:#### Test: Reviews list updates after writing a new review\n1216:#### Test: Reviews list shows multiple reviews in chronological order\n1221:## Page: Write Review (`/trips/:bookingId/review`)\n1225:### Component: PropertyBookingContext\n1227:#### Test: Property info displays for the booking being reviewed\n1232:#### Test: Property booking context shows guest count\n1237:#### Test: Property booking context shows total price paid\n1242:#### Test: Redirect to login if not authenticated\n1247:#### Test: Error state when booking does not exist\n1252:#### Test: Error state when booking belongs to another user\n1257:#### Test: Error state when booking is not completed\n1262:#### Test: Error state when review already exists for booking\n1267:### Component: RatingSliders\n1269:#### Test: All six rating sliders display with default values\n1273:#### Test: Adjust overall rating slider\n1278:#### Test: Adjust cleanliness rating slider\n1283:#### Test: Adjust accuracy rating slider\n1288:#### Test: Adjust communication rating slider\n1293:#### Test: Adjust location rating slider\n1298:#### Test: Adjust value rating slider\n1303:#### Test: Rating sliders enforce 1-5 range\n1308:#### Test: Multiple sliders can be set independently\n1313:#### Test: Rating slider visual feedback shows filled stars or highlighted segments\n1318:### Component: ReviewForm\n1320:#### Test: Review form displays comment text area\n1324:#### Test: Submit button is visible\n1328:#### Test: Type a comment in the text area\n1333:#### Test: Submit review with all ratings and comment\n1338:#### Test: Submitted review appears on property detail page\n1343:#### Test: Submitted review appears in user profile reviews list\n1348:#### Test: Submit review with ratings but no comment\n1353:#### Test: Submit button is disabled when ratings are not set\n1357:#### Test: Form validation prevents submission without all ratings\n1362:#### Test: Write Review button on My Trips disappears after submitting review\n1367:#### Test: Navigate back from review page without submitting\n1372:#### Test: Comment text area allows multi-line input\n1377:#### Test: Re-visiting review page after submission shows already-reviewed state","numLines":313}}
