import/upload dialogs in Host Dashboard. N/A\n\n**Directive 12: Backend integrations must include setup instructions.**\n- No webhook/API integrations in Host Dashboard. N/A\n\n**Directive 13: Interactive elements used repeatedly must have multi-use tests.**\n- \"Deactivate and activate actions work on repeated use\" ✅\n- \"Status filters work on repeated use\" ✅\n- \"Confirm and cancel actions work on repeated use\" ✅\n- \"Add Listing form works correctly on repeated use\" ✅\n\n**Directive 14: State-changing actions must test that other parts of app update.**\n- Deactivation → stats update ✅\n- Booking confirm/cancel → stats update ✅\n- Publish listing → stats update ✅\n\nNo violations found for testSpec.md directives in the Host Dashboard test entries."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2189,"cache_read_input_tokens":50937,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2189,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6906f647-fc66-40dd-bce6-1567d9ff29c1","uuid":"04d188f6-cdd6-4221-a791-d5b5bc8751b4"}
