g applied only at the page level ✅\n\n17. **\"Gate dependent API calls on prerequisite data being loaded\"** — HostDashboard correctly waits for host status before fetching host data ✅\n\nEverything checks out against the requirements. Let me reconsider one more time to make sure I haven't missed anything.\n\nActually, I should verify the custom dropdown directive — BookingsTab uses custom button filters rather than native select elements, and AddListingForm implements a custom dropdown for property type selection instead of a native select ✅. Now checking the overflow handling: ListingsTab's card has the status badge positioned absolutely within an overflow-hidden image container, and the badge stays within bounds based on its positioning, so that's fine.\n\nThe component review looks solid, so I'll move on to examining the test files.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4823,"cache_read_input_tokens":81048,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4823,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6906f647-fc66-40dd-bce6-1567d9ff29c1","uuid":"8569f6e2-7d12-4667-9eca-5437d7e64575"}
